From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ole Algoritme <olealgoritme@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 9 Oct 2026 06:00:56 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] nvk: NVK_PASS_PROFILE=5 dumps one render pass's draws

vk_gpubench cs2like with CS2's pass shape (indirect calls, rebinding,
compute-written records, pipelines, descriptor buffers, push constants,
an alpha-test FS, CS2's vertex layout) runs at 0.28 us per draw on NVK
(0.19 native), while CS2's depth prepass costs 20-36 us per draw.  To
replay CS2's exact draw state, NVK_PASS_PROFILE=5 dumps one instance of a
render pass:

- NVK_PASS_DUMP_DELAY_S (default 20) seconds after device creation, the
  next pass whose signature contains NVK_PASS_DUMP (default
  "x2 layers 1, 0 rt z D24_UNORM_S8_UINT", the depth prepass) is dumped;
- per draw call: the call (draw, draw-indexed or multi-draw with its
  first draw's parameters; indirect address, drawCount, stride), the
  vertex and fragment shader code hashes (as in NVK_SHADER_STATS),
  topology, primitive restart, cull mode, depth test/write/compare,
  depth bounds, stencil test and depth bias enables, the index buffer
  (address, size, type), each vertex binding (stride, input rate,
  divisor, bound address and size) and attribute (binding, format,
  offset);
- the indirect records themselves: each call's range is copied by the
  copy engine into a mapped buffer when the pass executes, and the
  harvest thread writes them (indexCount, instanceCount, firstIndex,
  vertexOffset, firstInstance) once a report after the pass has landed.

Written to NVK_PASS_DUMP_FILE, else
%ProgramData%\Helios\nvk-prepass-dump-<pid>.txt on Windows.  Level 5
includes levels 1-4.  Off by default; no MME change.
---
 src/nouveau/vulkan/nvk_cmd_buffer.h   |   2 +
 src/nouveau/vulkan/nvk_cmd_draw.c     |  25 +++
 src/nouveau/vulkan/nvk_pass_profile.c | 290 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 src/nouveau/vulkan/nvk_pass_profile.h |   7 +
 4 files changed, 324 insertions(+)

diff --git a/src/nouveau/vulkan/nvk_cmd_buffer.h b/src/nouveau/vulkan/nvk_cmd_buffer.h
index 1e83da30..9869fa60 100644
--- a/src/nouveau/vulkan/nvk_cmd_buffer.h
+++ b/src/nouveau/vulkan/nvk_cmd_buffer.h
@@ -363,6 +363,8 @@ struct nvk_cmd_buffer {
    bool pass_profile_in_pass;
    bool pass_profile_on;
    bool pass_profile_buffers;
+   bool pass_profile_dump;
+   uint32_t pass_profile_dump_call;
    /* NVK_PASS_PROFILE=4: where the open pass's pushes start */
    uint32_t pass_profile_hist_sig;
    uint32_t pass_profile_hist_npushes;
diff --git a/src/nouveau/vulkan/nvk_cmd_draw.c b/src/nouveau/vulkan/nvk_cmd_draw.c
index 1bbf6290..6e20d2ad 100644
--- a/src/nouveau/vulkan/nvk_cmd_draw.c
